---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | Airport Runways Live"
  description="Privacy policy for Airport Runways Live. We do not sell personal data."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>We do not sell personal data.</p>
      <p>
        Contact and “add a stream” forms open your email client and send to hello@airportrunwayslive.com. If you email
        us, we keep what we need to reply.
      </p>
      <p>
        Analytics, if added later, will be optional and documented here. There is no cookie wall on this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        YouTube embeds are served by Google. Their player may set cookies according to YouTube’s own policy. We load
        at most one embed unless you open Multiview (two official players).
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
